  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrading Migrant Facilities and Installation of MIDAS at Selected Port of Entries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide upgrading of the passenger terminal in Berbera Seaport; upgrading of training and referral center in Hargeisa; replacement of equipment an update of Migration Information and Data Analysis System (MIDAS) installed version at identified ports of entries (PoEs); installation of sustainable solar power solutions to ensure continuous power supply for MIDAS at PoEs; and development of comprehensive immigration border management training package for various border management institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
